---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Choices | KiTech Software"
  description="Options for exercising privacy rights and contacting KiTech Software about personal information."
  canonicalPath="/privacy/choices/"
>
  <main id="main-content" class="info-page" tabindex="-1">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy choices</p>
      <h1>Manage your privacy rights</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        You may contact KiTech Software to ask how your personal information is used or to exercise a right available under applicable data-protection law.
      </p>

      <section class="panel">
        <h2>Available requests</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>access personal information held about you;</li>
          <li>correct inaccurate or incomplete information;</li>
          <li>request deletion of eligible information;</li>
          <li>restrict or object to certain processing;</li>
          <li>request portable information where the right applies;</li>
          <li>withdraw consent;</li>
          <li>object to direct marketing; and</li>
          <li>ask for human review of an eligible automated decision.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="panel">
        <h2>Submit a request</h2>
        <p>
          Email <a href="mailto:hello@kitechsoftware.com?subject=Privacy%20request">hello@kitechsoftware.com</a> with the subject <strong>Privacy request</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>Include the relevant product, account email or username, organisation or deployment, and the right you want to exercise.</p>
        <p>Do not send passwords, recovery codes, private keys, or unnecessary identity documents.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="panel">
        <h2>Verification and response</h2>
        <p>
          We may need to verify your identity or authority before responding. We use proportionate verification and will explain when additional information is required.
        </p>
        <p>
          Rights may be limited by lawful exemptions, another person's rights, legal obligations, security needs, or KiTech's role as a processor rather than controller.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="panel">
        <h2>Organisation-managed services</h2>
        <p>
          For employer, customer, partner, school, charity, community, or self-hosted accounts, the responsible organisation may control the information and must handle the request. We will direct you to that organisation where appropriate.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="panel">
        <h2>Complaints</h2>
        <p>
          You may complain to the UK Information Commissioner's Office or another competent data-protection authority. We encourage you to contact us first so we can try to resolve the concern.
        </p>
        <p>See the full <a href="/legal/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .info-page { min-height: 70vh; padding: 88px 0 112px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--surface-grad-a), var(--surface)); }
  .narrow { max-width: 860px; }
  h1 { max-width: 760px; font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5rem); }
  .lead { max-width: 760px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.18rem; }
  .panel { margin-top: 24px; padding: 30px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--card-bg); }
  .panel h2 { margin-bottom: 12px; }
  li + li { margin-top: 8px; }
  @media (max-width: 720px) { .info-page { padding: 68px 0 88px; } }
</style>
